  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Near San Cha Mountain, Tie Ba Xiu steps forward as Fang Yuan closes on Tie Ruo Nan, and their clash sends both back several steps. Tyrant strength Gu gives him the strength of an overlord in that exchange.",
        "chapters": [
          360
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_tie_ba_xiu",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_tie_ruo_nan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Tie Ba Xiu also has rank five earth overlord Gu, which lets him absorb strength from the earth and empower tyrant strength Gu further. He keeps activating earth overlord Gu so formless earth strength feeds tyrant strength Gu and his power keeps rising.",
        "chapters": [
          360
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "with-earth-overlord-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_earth_overlord_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Even while he cannot show his full strength, that continuous empowerment pushes tyrant strength Gu past Fang Yuan’s limits.",
        "chapters": [
          363
        ],
